  <item>
    <title>3_超强密度吐槽原生家庭 “看谁斗得过谁！”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a42736ec448b75fdc6e10d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a42736ec448b75fdc6e10d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Jul 2023 14:05:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期邀请了Ava和Tris，一起聊了聊各自有毒的原生家庭。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可能是压抑在心里的积怨太深、故事太多，一直聊到了天亮。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Leslie得益于从小爱反抗，成为我们四人中最幸福的；Tia自救纯靠顿悟；</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tris冷漠又理性；Ava终于迈出逃离原生家庭第一步……</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望本期节目，可以让你找到一些共鸣或慰藉，获得一些力量，或者就听个乐儿~</span></p><span></span><p><span>都在酒里了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间目录】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 刚下高铁就被父母语言暴击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a>"谁会管你这些，我是你妈才会管你”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a>最难过的点是，我在外面受了委屈，我妈却让我忍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a>小时候因为懂事没得到的洋娃娃，成为了一个执念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a>想要个生日蛋糕，我爸直接把我扔店里走了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="548">09:08</a>18岁生日妈妈不记得，14岁生日妈妈去烫头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a>因为弟弟挨打之后想自杀，想让他没有姐姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a>“看谁能斗得过谁”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a>你们在乎收到的爱是有条件的吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a>“爱你弟是发自内心，爱你是道德准则和政治正确”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a>家产是男宝的，家务是女宝的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a>我从小就在反抗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">23:08</a>爸爸参与过我的成长吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1449">24:09</a>我是我妈的情绪垃圾桶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a>“我都是因为你才不离婚的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a>垃圾桶当久了也会麻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a>所以我对亲密关系的态度变成这样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2078">34:38</a>不完全自救指南</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tia：网上马甲：呸，INFP，双鱼座，天天打拳</span></p><span></span><p><span>Leslie：ESFJ→ISTJ，白羊座，天天学习</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ava：女宝就没有家啊！我在哪家在哪！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tris：我是Tris</span></p><span></span><p><span>LETTING来听，记录我们日常来不及说的，不重要但也重要的情绪和想法。</span></p>]]></description>
